R.A.T.S. Clean Screen: hides the game's beta version label

On the Steam beta branch the game draws its version text above everything. It lies over the title bars of windows, on the map and on the windows of other mods. This mod switches that text off. It does nothing else.

[b]What it does[/b]
[list]
[*]Keeps the game's own version label off the screen
[*]One setting, Hide version label, on by default. Off brings the label back
[/list]

[b]Setup[/b] Switch it on in the game's Mods menu and restart. It runs with R.A.T.S. Keel.

Requires [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3835527459]R.A.T.S. Keel[/url].

[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3836386468]Workshop page[/url] · [url=https://github.com/struckl/SeaPowerCleanScreen]Source code (MIT)[/url]

If the text is still there on your setup, tell me and attach BepInEx\LogOutput.log or BepInEx\Keel-log.txt.
